# Changelog Tracking

- Always maintain `CHANGELOG.md` at the repo root
- After finishing each task item, append a new entry to `CHANGELOG.md`
- Track significant changes only, not tiny scratch edits
- Keep entries in sequence order using the next available number
- For each entry include
  - task item or task name
  - what changed
  - key files touched
  - short note on why the change was made
- Update the changelog in the same task where the work is completed
- Do not leave a completed significant task undocumented
